{"id":27854477929966,"type":"artist","name":"Jim O'Rourke","artist":null,"year":1969,"weight":37,"info":{"tags":["experimental","post-rock","Avant-Garde","indie","indie rock"],"country":"US","begin":"1969-01-18","kind":"Person","similar":["Gastr Del Sol","Natural Snow Buildings","Loose Fur","Boredoms","Eiko Ishibashi","Ground Zero","Arthur Russell","Sam Prekop","James Ferraro","David Grubbs"],"disambiguation":"US musician & producer, b. 1969","img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Jim_O%27Rourke-11.jpg?width=500","bio":"Jim O’Rourke (nacido el 18 de enero de 1969) es un músico y productor estadounidense, asociado por largo tiempo a la escena experimental de Chicago. Conocido por tener gustos excéntricos y como un experto en música moderna experimental, O’Rourke ha lanzado discos de jazz, noise y rock. Ha colaborado con gente como Bobby Conn, Derek Bailey, Stereolab, Loren Mazzacame Connors, Nurse With Wound, Fennesz, Organum, Henry Kaiser, Flying Saucer Attack, y más recientemente produjo el álbum Ys de Joanna Newsom."},"works":[{"id":211730996790387,"type":"album","name":"Remove the Need","artist":"Jim O'Rourke","year":1989,"weight":6,"yt":"AO56_j52F8E","src":"books","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[],"n_lists":0}},{"id":160607100655411,"type":"album","name":"Tamper","artist":"Jim O'Rourke","year":1991,"weight":6,"yt":"G2g6L8Xg-ic","src":"books","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[],"n_lists":0}},{"id":203429826974097,"type":"album","name":"The Ground Below Above Our Heads","artist":"Jim O'Rourke","year":1991,"weight":6,"yt":"srkl87E_4H4","src":"books","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[],"n_lists":0}},{"id":49581509892897,"type":"album","name":"Disengage","artist":"Jim O'Rourke","year":1